| Purpose                   | Command                              |
| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |
| Enter privileged mode     | `enable`                             |
| Enter configuration       | `configure terminal`                 |
| Rename device             | `hostname SW1`                       |
| Select interface          | `interface fa0/1`                    |
| Set IP                    | `ip address IP MASK`                 |
| Turn interface on         | `no shutdown`                        |
| Leave current mode        | `exit`                               |
| Return to privileged mode | `end`                                |
| View configuration        | `show running-config`                |
| View IP interfaces        | `show ip interface brief`            |
| View VLANs                | `show vlan brief`                    |
| Save configuration        | `copy running-config startup-config` |
| Test connectivity         | `ping IP-address`                    |
